もありえるけど、それはもう個別にインストール方法とか内部のリソースの配置とか見て考えるしかないかな\n大概は気にしなくて大丈夫だけど","ts":"1616423664.078200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mx8cv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45895ca7-a239-4c26-a726-b607ea03b821","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"お～、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1616423548.077200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tYq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7569536e-4064-48e5-8f4a-33512b77ba6f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いまんとこ、自分でやらかした事例は vitalのことと、あとctrlpの拡張もってるプラグイン同士が衝突したことがあるくらいかな","ts":"1616423443.076900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o=Br"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fa5fb4a-9f50-4d98-9bc2-e54d2e4a42de","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まえーは ./server とかに入れてたんだよね","ts":"1616423378.076200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xH+e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6177ba8c-1143-431f-bd80-e079888ef62a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど","ts":"1616423367.075900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6TWhq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f402c14e-ab14-4243-a656-20a083cfbd44","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いや %APPDATA% つかうから大丈夫か","ts":"1616423362.075600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R9B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0aa6ebe0-6914-4f1b-88e3-be962f588faa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"vim-lsp-settings、XDGのディレクトリ使ったようなって思ったけどWindowsだと違うのか","ts":"1616423347.075300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ZGT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"711454fb-9be9-495d-8ca5-52bbfad987c2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、vim-lsp-settingsはもうやってないかも、自前設定するようにしちゃったので、古い知識の可能性あり","ts":"1616423343.075200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qZkb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"356fcaef-97e6-4c2b-bf9e-94505e0f34c3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"一般化するとするなら、同名ファイルが衝突する可能性があるのは両方をmerged = 0にしないとちょっと怖い、くらいかなあ","ts":"1616423304.074300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wkQ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2dd3d0f-5369-4339-9f5a-3116cf4123e8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"などなど","ts":"1616423248.073600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"slP15"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af1ccc6f-93dd-487c-91eb-6adc424d7cac","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いまわかってるというと\n• fzfとfzf.vim\n• vital.vim(インストール処理にリポジトリに直にアクセスするため、キャッシュされると都合がわるい)\n• vim-lsp-settings (素の設定だと、リポジトリの中にlsをインストールするので、キャッシュはあまり嬉しくないことになる) ただやってもどうにかなるけど\n• あと外部拡張系があるやつがキャッシュと相性がイマイチなことがあるので、merged = 0にしちゃうのが無難(ただうまくいくのもあるだろうけど、検証がしきれてない)","ts":"1616423222.073400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w5Yz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f63a6c93-803d-422b-9637-18413f696af3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"merge しちゃまずいプラグイン、大体の場合はプラグイン側の構造に問題がある","ts":"1616423137.072100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":2,"users":["U76GA7MFA","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhDH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75145f85-dea5-49d8-a216-133ced93175e","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"merge しちゃまずいプラグイン情報があるといいなぁ |ω・`）チラ","ts":"1616422901.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YTFG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5556e9dc-aa47-494e-bc4c-4798111d5891","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんか変、が頻発するなら、mergeしちゃまずいのが含まれてる、とかありえますので、そっちも確認検討したほうがいいかも","ts":"1616421742.070200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"42UD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42d90cb8-3219-414b-a466-eb910704cc2f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"とりあえず、それでなんとかなりそうです。ありがとうございます","ts":"1616421686.069500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AKiD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cbfd537-4321-44e7-ada7-d66494f8571b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`recache_runtimepath()` でした","ts":"1616421672.069100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1jVL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"789924a8-ad9e-4309-8a7b-4b8087bc2d87","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあrecacheは更新1つで走るから意味はあまりないけど","ts":"1616420342.068600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"evd+t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a56a9bdb-75d4-4c01-a1f0-125a21c05e6e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"魔法の言葉 `rm -rf`","ts":"1616420339.068500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j3f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe8c6c65-9651-489a-a113-ebf565cf118f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"作りなおすなら、`dein#recache_runtime()` とか `dein#reinstall(['hoge', 'fuga'])` とか","ts":"1616420322.068100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L/y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fdee0425-890f-46f0-af6a-b4f3917b90a6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"dein.vim の調子が悪いときって、`dein#clear_state()` 以外に叩くといい関数ありませんでしたっけ？","ts":"1616420212.067400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Jux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd4b03b6-b735-4c2c-8662-a49667849d94","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"大元をなるべく被りに